ws/ >Trends</a></li> <li><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/women-empowerment/ >Women Empowerment</a></li> <li><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/relationships/ >Relationships</a></li></ul></li> <li> <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/tools/ >Tools</a> </li></ul></div></section><input type=hidden name=countryvalidate class=countryvalidate id=countryvalidate value><div id=sc-sticky-ad-bottom><div id=div-gpt-ad-1584437321458-0></div></div><div class="containergod container" id=container style=max-width:1064px;><div id=inner-wrap><div id=primary class=hfeed style=max-width:720px;display:inline-block;width:100%;><div id=content> <input type=hidden id=post_id_scroll value=215625 data-post-id=215625><article class="entry-content "><section class=under-title><header class=entry-header><p id=breadcrumbs> <span> <span><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com>Home</a></span> » <span><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/news/trends-news/ >Trends</a></span> » <span><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/news/trends-news/flowers/ >Flowers</a></span> </span></p><h1 class="entry-title" id="entry-title215625" data-url="https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-blue-flowers/">25 Most Beautiful Blue Flowers</h1><p>Add a touch of blue to liven up your gardens with these exceptionally beautiful flowers.</p><div class=single-pmeta><div class="pull-left pullauthor-details " id=popauthor215625> By<div id=auModal class=modal><div class=modal-content> <span class=au_close>×</span><div class=grid> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png.webp><img alt=author height=80 width=80 class=webpexpress-processed data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png.webp type=image/webp><img src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png alt=author height=80 width=80 class=webpexpress-processed></picture></noscript><div class=social_in><p><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ >Ramya Karamsetti </a></p><div class=social-links><div class=author_linked_profile></div></div></div></div><div class=modulereadmore><p class="collapse bio" aria-expanded=false>Ramya Karamsetti is a contributor to StyleCraze. She loves writing articles on beauty, health, and wellness and advocates using natural remedies to solve everyday skin and hair issues. When she is not... <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ target=_blank>more</a></p></div></div></div><div class=authorpopover id=authorpopover215625 style="display: none;"><div class=blocker onclick=popupCloseFunction(this)></div> <a class=close-btn onclick=popupCloseFunction(this)>X</a><div class=pop_cover><div class=popover_top><div class=grid> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png.webp><img alt=author height=80 width=80 class=webpexpress-processed data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png.webp type=image/webp><img src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png alt=author height=80 width=80 class=webpexpress-processed></picture></noscript><div class=social_in><p><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ >Ramya Karamsetti </a></p><div class=social-links><div class=author_linked_profile></div></div></div></div><div class=modulereadmore><p class="collapse bio" aria-expanded=false>Ramya Karamsetti is a contributor to StyleCraze. She loves writing articles on beauty, health, and wellness and advocates using natural remedies to solve everyday skin and hair issues. When she is not... <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ target=_blank>more</a></p></div></div></div></div> <span class=author_name><a class=deskonly id=dcname215625 href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ >Ramya Karamsetti</a><a class="ds-mobonly au_modal" id=dcname215625>Ramya Karamsetti</a></span>	 •  <time datetime=2023-05-26T13:31:27+05:30> May 26, 2023</time></div><div class=clearfix></div></div></header></section><section class="newpin featured-img" style=width:100%><picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/25-Most-Beautiful-Blue-Flowers.jpg.webp><img class="img-responsive wp-post-image webpexpress-processed" alt="25 Most Beautiful Blue Flowers" width=720 height=810 style=min-width:100% data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/25-Most-Beautiful-Blue-Flowers.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/noimage720x810.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/25-Most-Beautiful-Blue-Flowers.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/25-Most-Beautiful-Blue-Flowers.jpg class="img-responsive wp-post-image webpexpress-processed" alt="25 Most Beautiful Blue Flowers" data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/noimage720x810.jpg.webp width=720 height=810 style=min-width:100%></picture></noscript><div class=newpinit_sc_new> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-blue-flowers/&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/25-Most-Beautiful-Blue-Flowers.jpg&description=25%20Most%20Beautiful%20Blue%20Flowers" data-pin-tall=true data-pin-height=28 alt=Pinit class="pin_image_share aligncenter lh-preload"></a></div><div id=attachment_1035984 class="wp-caption alignnone"><p id=caption-attachment-1035984 class=wp-caption-text>Image: Shutterstock</p></div></section><section><article id=post-215625 class="post-215625 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-articles category-flowers"><div class=entry-content><p>Blue colour is everlastingly appointed by the deity to be a source of delight.” — John Ruskin</p><div id=ubvideoad class=advertinside style=min-height:250px;><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([ubvideoad_slot]);});</script></div><div id=vignette><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([SC_Vignette_Ads]);});</script></div><div id=quantcast><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([SC_Quantcast_TCF]);});</script></div><p><strong>The beautiful blue flowers convey the message of love, desire, and the supreme struggle to reach the zenith.</strong> They are one of the rarest flowers found in the world and create a contemplative mood by virtue of their cooling and calming effect.</p><p>At the same time, it is believed that blue flowers slow down metabolism and reduce appetite. Blue is a color that is associated with intellect and spirituality. It has calming effects and helps one to sleep better.</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container><div class=advertinsidehb id=first_ad style=min-height:400px;></div></div></div></div></div><p>While light blue is the color of serenity, calmness, and peace, dark blue conveys importance and confidence. However, the gorgeous blue flowers stand for loyalty, trust, intelligence, wisdom, truth, faith, and confidence and give a sense of stability, confidence, honesty, and security.</p><h5>The Loveliest Blue Flowers In the World</h5><p>Here are some of the most beautiful blue flowers found across the globe.</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container-hide><div class id=viewdeos-player style=min-height:150px;><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([viewdeos_slot]);});</script></div></div></div></div></div><div id=BackToToc class=toc-container><div class=sc-toc-title-container><p class=sc-toc-title>In This Article</p></div><nav><ul class="sc-toc-list toctop "><li><a href=#1-blue-hydrangea title="1. Blue hydrangea:">1. Blue hydrangea:</a></li><li><a href=#2-delphinium title=2. Delphinium:>2. Delphinium:</a></li><li><a href=#3-dandelion title=3. Dandelion:>3. Dandelion:</a></li><li><a href=#4-grape-hyacinth title="4. Grape Hyacinth:">4. Grape Hyacinth:</a></li><li><a href=#5-clematis title=5. Clematis:>5. Clematis:</a></li><li><a href=#6-bluestar title=6. Bluestar:>6. Bluestar:</a></li><li><a href=#7-bellflower title=7. Bellflower:>7. Bellflower:</a></li><li><a href=#8-balloon-flower title="8. Balloon Flower:">8. Balloon Flower:</a></li><li><a href=#9-aster title=9. Aster:>9. Aster:</a></li><li><a href=#10-morning-glories title="10. Morning Glories:">10. Morning Glories:</a></li><li><a href=#11-blue-hibiscus-flower title="11. Blue Hibiscus Flower:">11. Blue Hibiscus Flower:</a></li><li><a href=#12-impatiens-flower title="12. Impatiens Flower:">12. Impatiens Flower:</a></li><li><a href=#13-iris title=13. Iris:>13. Iris:</a></li><li><a href=#14-violet-flower title="14. Violet Flower:">14. Violet Flower:</a></li><li><a href=#15-gentian title=15. Gentian:>15. Gentian:</a></li><li><a href=#16-forget-me-not title="16. Forget me not:">16. Forget me not:</a></li><li><a href=#17-bachelor-button-flower title="17. Bachelor Button Flower:">17. Bachelor Button Flower:</a></li><li><a href=#18-blue-fringed-daisy title="18. Blue Fringed Daisy:">18. Blue Fringed Daisy:</a></li><li><a href=#19-ipomoea-flower title="19. Ipomoea flower:">19. Ipomoea flower:</a></li><li><a href=#20-blue-calla-lilies title="20. Blue calla lilies:">20. Blue calla lilies:</a></li><li><a href=#21-blue-orchids title="21. Blue orchids:">21. Blue orchids:</a></li><li><a href=#22-blue-carnation title="22. Blue carnation:">22. Blue carnation:</a></li><li><a href=#23-columbine title=23. Columbine:>23. Columbine:</a></li><li><a href=#24-anemone title=24. Anemone:>24. Anemone:</a></li><li><a href=#25-brunnea title=25. Brunnea:>25. Brunnea:</a></li><li><a href=#infographic-top-10-brilliant-blue-flowers-for-your-garden title="Infographic: Top 10 Brilliant Blue Flowers For Your Garden">Infographic: Top 10 Brilliant Blue Flowers For Your Garden</a></li><li><a href=#frequently-asked-questions title="Frequently Asked Questions">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=1-blue-hydrangea>1. Blue hydrangea:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue hydrangea conveys a strong feeling of love" alt="Blue hydrangea conveys a strong feeling of love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue hydrangea conveys a strong feeling of love" alt="Blue hydrangea conveys a strong feeling of love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue hydrangea conveys a strong feeling of love" alt="Blue hydrangea conveys a strong feeling of love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-hydrangea.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p><strong>Blue hydrangea is an absolute breathtaking flower.</strong> Some blue hydrangeas come in vivid and striking colours (like deep indigo), while some are in subtle shades like powder blue or sky blue. The shades of blue vary according to the alkalinity of the soil. Blue hydrangea flowers convey a heartfelt and strong feeling of love when given as a gift.<br> via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/63754150947945022/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a><br></p><div class=protip_external><div class=protip_inner><div class=protip_title><img class="nopin lh-lazy-image" alt=protip_icon width=32px height=32px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/protips/didyouknow.svg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/noimage-min.jpg><noscript><img class=nopin data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/noimage-min.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/protips/didyouknow.svg alt=protip_icon width=32px height=32px></noscript> Did You Know?</div><div class=protip_content>The soil pH determines the color of hydrangeas. If the soil is more acidic, the hydrangeas will be blue, while the flowers turn pink if the soil is alkaline.</div></div></div><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container><div class=advertinsidehb id=second_ad style=min-height:400px;></div></div></div></div></div><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=2-delphinium>2. Delphinium:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Delphinium stands for fun and intense attachment" alt="Delphinium stands for fun and intense attachment" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Delphinium stands for fun and intense attachment" alt="Delphinium stands for fun and intense attachment" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Delphinium stands for fun and intense attachment" alt="Delphinium stands for fun and intense attachment" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Delphinium.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p><strong>Delphinium flowers come in some of the truest shades of blue colour.</strong> This dolphin shaped flower stands for fun, levity, ardent attachment and big hearted in the language of flowers.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/552676185492007053/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=3-dandelion>3. Dandelion:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Dandelion represents happiness and tranquillity" alt="Dandelion represents happiness and tranquillity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Dandelion represents happiness and tranquillity" alt="Dandelion represents happiness and tranquillity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Dandelion represents happiness and tranquillity" alt="Dandelion represents happiness and tranquillity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Dandelion1.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p><strong>Dandelion flower is associated with love, affection, desire, sympathy while the blue dandelion flower represents faithfulness, happiness and tranquillity.</strong> Dandelion is a <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-flowers-in-the-world/ >popular flower</a> in folklore and legends and has been symbolic in a variety of cultures. These flowers are native to Europe and Asia but are now available widely across the world.</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container-hide><div class=advertinside style=min-height:150px; id=connatix_playspace><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([connatix_playspace]);});</script></div></div></div></div></div><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/448530444108823586/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=4-grape-hyacinth>4. Grape Hyacinth:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Grape hyacinth has a unique bulb-shaped bloom" alt="Grape hyacinth has a unique bulb-shaped bloom" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Grape hyacinth has a unique bulb-shaped bloom" alt="Grape hyacinth has a unique bulb-shaped bloom" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Grape hyacinth has a unique bulb-shaped bloom" alt="Grape hyacinth has a unique bulb-shaped bloom" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Grape-Hyacinth.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>This flower is a very beautiful and unique bulb shaped bloom which grows in clusters in mid spring. They are found in purple, white and yellow varieties. <strong>Grape hyacinth is associated with rebirth and represents games, sports, rashness and playful joy.</strong> Grape hyacinth symbolizes constancy and trust.</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container><div class=advertinsidehb id=third_ad style=min-height:400px;></div></div></div></div></div><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/384494886906415649/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><div class=sc-rltd-head>Related: <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-aster-flowers/ title="15 Most Beautiful Aster Flowers (Pictures) For Decoration" class=sc-reltd>15 Most Beautiful Aster Flowers (Pictures) For Decoration</a></div><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=5-clematis>5. Clematis:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Clematis is a widely used ornamental flower" alt="Clematis is a widely used ornamental flower" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Clematis is a widely used ornamental flower" alt="Clematis is a widely used ornamental flower" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Clematis is a widely used ornamental flower" alt="Clematis is a widely used ornamental flower" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Clematis.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Clematis is a flowering climber plant that is mostly used for ornamental purpose. ‘Crystal fountain’, ‘Ice Blue’, and ‘Arbella’ are some true blue varieties of this flower. The meaning of clematis is mental prowess. The blue clematis signifies faithfulness, ingenuity and courage.</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container-hide><div class id=viewdeos_AI_second_Slot style=min-height:150px;><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([viewdeos_second_slot]);});</script></div></div></div></div></div><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/232920611948766826/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=6-bluestar>6. Bluestar:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Bluestar blooms in clusters and signifies affection" alt="Bluestar blooms in clusters and signifies affection" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Bluestar blooms in clusters and signifies affection" alt="Bluestar blooms in clusters and signifies affection" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Bluestar blooms in clusters and signifies affection" alt="Bluestar blooms in clusters and signifies affection" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bluestar.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Blue star flower is a perfect blue flower for gardens. It blooms in clear blue clusters on greenish yellow foliage. It signifies steadfastness and affection.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/216032113345104039/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=7-bellflower>7. Bellflower:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Charming bellflowers embody gratitude and humility" alt="Charming bellflowers embody gratitude and humility" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Charming bellflowers embody gratitude and humility" alt="Charming bellflowers embody gratitude and humility" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Charming bellflowers embody gratitude and humility" alt="Charming bellflowers embody gratitude and humility" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bellflower.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Bellflowers are charming starry or bell shaped flowers that bloom in several colours like violet pink, purple and white.  The long stemmed varieties are great cut flowers. This is a pearl deep blue cup shaped flower with light yellow centers. Its dark green foliage complements the blue colour finely. The flower symbolism associated with this flower is humility, constancy and gratitude. Bell flowers are also related to the realm of fairies and are referred as ‘fairy thimbles’.</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container><div class=advertinsidehb id=fourth_ad style=min-height:400px;></div></div></div></div></div><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/448882287829306575/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=8-balloon-flower>8. Balloon Flower:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Balloon flowers are ideal for decorative purposes" alt="Balloon flowers are ideal for decorative purposes" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Balloon flowers are ideal for decorative purposes" alt="Balloon flowers are ideal for decorative purposes" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Balloon flowers are ideal for decorative purposes" alt="Balloon flowers are ideal for decorative purposes" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Balloon-Flower.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Balloon flowers are stunning balloon-shaped buds that open to beautiful blue, pink or white shaped blooms with striking red pistils. This flower can be used best for decoration purposes or for flower arrangement with this flower as a lovely backdrop. It stands for love, honesty, obedience. These flowers would make a great gift for some who are extremely special to you.</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet-connatix><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container-hide><div class=advertinside style=min-height:250px; id=connatix><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([connatix_slot]);});</script></div></div></div></div></div><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/394416879836605425/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=9-aster>9. Aster:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Aster is associated with love and peace" alt="Aster is associated with love and peace" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Aster is associated with love and peace" alt="Aster is associated with love and peace" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Aster is associated with love and peace" alt="Aster is associated with love and peace" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Aster.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Aster is the last plant to bloom in a year and come in colors like red, purple, blue, pink, yellow and white. The flower symbolism associated with asters is daintiness, love and peace. Asters are also believed to possess healing properties. In the ancient times, it was believed that burning aster flower leaves would drive away evil and other thing associated with it</p><div class=flying-carpet-wrapper><div class=fx-flying-carpet><div class=fx-flying-carpet-clip><div class=fx-flying-carpet-container><div class=advertinsidehb id=fifth_ad style=min-height:400px;></div></div></div></div></div><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/36310340718997953/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=10-morning-glories>10. Morning Glories:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Morning glories are ideal for decorative purposes" alt="Morning glories are ideal for decorative purposes" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Morning glories are ideal for decorative purposes" alt="Morning glories are ideal for decorative purposes" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Morning glories are ideal for decorative purposes" alt="Morning glories are ideal for decorative purposes" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Morning-Glories.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Morning glory is a saucer shaped flower that blooms in colors like blue, yellow, purple, red and pink. This star shaped flower is aptly named morning glory as the flower blooms during the day and dies by evening. These flowers symbolize love and affection. These are used for ornamental purpose in wedding and parties.</p><div id=vidcrunch-ai class="vidcrunch advertinside" style=min-height:150px;><script>googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([sc_vidcrunch]);});</script></div><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/520728775635009104/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=11-blue-hibiscus-flower>11. Blue Hibiscus Flower:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue hibiscus flower represents depth and serenity" alt="Blue hibiscus flower represents depth and serenity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue hibiscus flower represents depth and serenity" alt="Blue hibiscus flower represents depth and serenity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue hibiscus flower represents depth and serenity" alt="Blue hibiscus flower represents depth and serenity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Hibiscus-Flower.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Blue <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-hibiscus-flowers/ >Hibiscus flowers</a> are rare to be found and look exotic in shape and colour. Hibiscus in general stands for delicate beauty while its blue variety symbolizes depth, infinity, serenity and unexplainable splendour. This rare beauty that glorifies the flower land also represents fertility.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/37576978112929100/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=12-impatiens-flower>12. Impatiens Flower:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Impatiens flower symbolizes motherly love" alt="Impatiens flower symbolizes motherly love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Impatiens flower symbolizes motherly love" alt="Impatiens flower symbolizes motherly love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Impatiens flower symbolizes motherly love" alt="Impatiens flower symbolizes motherly love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Impatiens-Flower.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Impatiens flower come in two varieties which include flat shaped impatiens flowers and orchid shaped impatiens. In the medieval time impatiens flowers were called ‘Our Lady’ Earring’. This flower symbolizes motherly love and affection.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/114278909266737918/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=13-iris>13. Iris:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Iris flower is associated with faith and wisdom" alt="Iris flower is associated with faith and wisdom" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Iris flower is associated with faith and wisdom" alt="Iris flower is associated with faith and wisdom" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Iris flower is associated with faith and wisdom" alt="Iris flower is associated with faith and wisdom" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Iris.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Iris flower is associated with faith, wisdom, cherished friendship, hope and valour. Iris flower was used in medieval times In the Mary Gardens. The blade shaped foliage of this flower denotes sorrows which pierce the heart. Iris has been recognized as the dancing spirit if the early summer for its different colors. Its fluttering petal often reminds me of butterfly wings flapping gently in the breeze.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/503981014520871174/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=14-violet-flower>14. Violet Flower:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Violets are edible flowers and signify modesty and love" alt="Violets are edible flowers and signify modesty and love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Violets are edible flowers and signify modesty and love" alt="Violets are edible flowers and signify modesty and love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Violets are edible flowers and signify modesty and love" alt="Violets are edible flowers and signify modesty and love" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Violet-Flower.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Violet is a pretty blue coloured flower symbolizing affection, modesty, watchfulness, love and happiness. Violets are edible flowers its essence is often used in desserts white its petals are used to decorate salads and desserts.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/242561129900182086/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=15-gentian>15. Gentian:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Rich-blue gentian flowers attract butterflies" alt="Rich-blue gentian flowers attract butterflies" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Rich-blue gentian flowers attract butterflies" alt="Rich-blue gentian flowers attract butterflies" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Rich-blue gentian flowers attract butterflies" alt="Rich-blue gentian flowers attract butterflies" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Gentian.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Gentian is a true blue colored flower with smooth green lance shaped leaves which is highly attractive to butterflies and hummingbirds.  Blue gentian is a very unique flower prevalent only in Europe. This unusual looking flower is mostly used as an alternative to <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-red-roses/ >traditional rose</a> and daisy. Blue gentian represents loveliness, intrinsic value and femininity.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/50806302016491136/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><div class=sc-rltd-head>Related: <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-hydrangea-flowers/ title="Top 15 Most Beautiful Hydrangea Flowers" class=sc-reltd>Top 15 Most Beautiful Hydrangea Flowers</a></div><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=16-forget-me-not>16. Forget me not:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Forget-me-not flowers symbolize love and remembrance" alt="Forget-me-not flowers symbolize love and remembrance" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Forget-me-not flowers symbolize love and remembrance" alt="Forget-me-not flowers symbolize love and remembrance" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Forget-me-not flowers symbolize love and remembrance" alt="Forget-me-not flowers symbolize love and remembrance" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Forget-me-not.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>This flower symbolizes true love and remembrance.  In the 15th century, it was believed that the wearers of this flower would not be forgotten by their lovers. This is a pretty little blue flower with yellow stamens and blooms mainly in summer.<br> via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/234116880599148632/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a><br></p><div class=protip_external><div class=protip_inner><div class=protip_title><img class="nopin lh-lazy-image" alt=protip_icon width=32px height=32px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/protips/trivia.svg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/noimage-min.jpg><noscript><img class=nopin data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/noimage-min.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/protips/trivia.svg alt=protip_icon width=32px height=32px></noscript> Trivia</div><div class=protip_content>King Henry Ⅳ loved forget-me-nots and made them the emblem of his court. It’s said that he had the image of the forget-me-not sewn into his and his courtiers’ garments.</div></div></div><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=17-bachelor-button-flower>17. Bachelor Button Flower:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Bachelor button flower embodies singlehood" alt="Bachelor button flower embodies singlehood" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Bachelor button flower embodies singlehood" alt="Bachelor button flower embodies singlehood" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Bachelor button flower embodies singlehood" alt="Bachelor button flower embodies singlehood" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Bachelor-Button-Flower.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>This flower is more commonly known as cornflower, basket flower and boutonniere flower. These blue flowers were prized historically for its pigment. In the olden days, bachelors would wear this flower to indicate his love for their beloved. If the love is not reciprocated, the flower would die quickly. It is also a national flower of Poland. The flower symbolizes celibacy, singlehood, and hope in love, delicacy and blessedness.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/150800287492835964/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=18-blue-fringed-daisy>18. Blue Fringed Daisy:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue fringed daisy is a symbol of simplicity and appreciation" alt="Blue fringed daisy is a symbol of simplicity and appreciation" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue fringed daisy is a symbol of simplicity and appreciation" alt="Blue fringed daisy is a symbol of simplicity and appreciation" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue fringed daisy is a symbol of simplicity and appreciation" alt="Blue fringed daisy is a symbol of simplicity and appreciation" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-Fringed-Daisy.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Daisies are classic flowers which are loved by one and all. Blue fringed daisies are beautiful and look even more unique and beautiful because of its blue color. This flower is named blue fringed daisy because it truly looks like fringe surrounded by a yellow and green center. It symbolizes simplicity, adoration and appreciation.</p><p>via <a href=http://www.michiganbulb.com/product/Blue_Fringe_Daisy rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=19-ipomoea-flower>19. Ipomoea flower:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Ipomoea flowers with large trumpet-shaped petals" alt="Ipomoea flowers with large trumpet-shaped petals" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Ipomoea flowers with large trumpet-shaped petals" alt="Ipomoea flowers with large trumpet-shaped petals" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Ipomoea flowers with large trumpet-shaped petals" alt="Ipomoea flowers with large trumpet-shaped petals" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Ipomoea-flower.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>This is one of the loveliest flowers with huge trumpet shaped petals in deep azure colour. It opens up its petal every dawn to embrace the new day and perishes before noon. The bright blue flower contrast very well with rich green leaves. These flowers are born in clusters on high stem.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/173318285631113306/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=20-blue-calla-lilies>20. Blue calla lilies:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue calla lilies convey feelings of gratitude and appreciation" alt="Blue calla lilies convey feelings of gratitude and appreciation" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue calla lilies convey feelings of gratitude and appreciation" alt="Blue calla lilies convey feelings of gratitude and appreciation" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue calla lilies convey feelings of gratitude and appreciation" alt="Blue calla lilies convey feelings of gratitude and appreciation" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-calla-lilies.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Blue calla lilies are magnificent looking flowers and are often used for weddings, parties, baptisms and even funerals. These exotic shaped flowers can be used at any occasion as they express feelings of gratitude and appreciation. Blue calla lilies symbolize royalty, serenity, peace and tranquillity. In the Romantic period, this flower symbolized love and desire.</p><p>via <a href=http://www.midwesternerinmexico.com/2009/01/19/mercado-de-jamaica-the-flower-market-of-mexico-city/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=21-blue-orchids>21. Blue orchids:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue orchids are rare and symbolize tranquillity" alt="Blue orchids are rare and symbolize tranquillity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue orchids are rare and symbolize tranquillity" alt="Blue orchids are rare and symbolize tranquillity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue orchids are rare and symbolize tranquillity" alt="Blue orchids are rare and symbolize tranquillity" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-orchids.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Orchids are highly coveted flowers that represent luxury, beauty and strength. Blue orchids are astonishingly beautiful flowers and are capable of attracting even people who do not appreciate flowers much. These flowers are quite rare to find but are extremely popular for its beauty. Blue orchids symbolize tranquillity and are associated with the deep and vast ocean for its blue and white colour. These flowers represent delicate beauty, power and stability.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/164240717633614616/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=22-blue-carnation>22. Blue carnation:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue carnations are a perfect choice for party decorations" alt="Blue carnations are a perfect choice for party decorations" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue carnations are a perfect choice for party decorations" alt="Blue carnations are a perfect choice for party decorations" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Blue carnations are a perfect choice for party decorations" alt="Blue carnations are a perfect choice for party decorations" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Blue-carnation1.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Blue carnations are fun and colourful flowers making them a perfect choice for party decorations. These charming flowers spread joy and elegance and are used widely for special occasions and gifting purposes. The light sky blue colour of this flower symbolizes peace and partiality. It also represents truth, thus it is widely used during weddings, indicating the clear response to the feeling of pure love a groom has for his bride.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/300544975102761511/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=23-columbine>23. Columbine:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Columbine has delicate petals and comes in various colors" alt="Columbine has delicate petals and comes in various colors" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Columbine has delicate petals and comes in various colors" alt="Columbine has delicate petals and comes in various colors" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Columbine has delicate petals and comes in various colors" alt="Columbine has delicate petals and comes in various colors" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Columbine.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Columbine is plant from the ranunculaceous genus with seemingly delicate petals and coloured sepals which give an appearance of a bunch of pigeons. The name is derived from the Latin word ‘aquila’ and stands for ‘dove’ in the language of flowers. The leaves are dark and bluish green in colour and the flower blooms in a beautiful blue colour with ferny foliage. It comes in colors like yellow, pink, red, maroon, violet and white.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/46795283597697828/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=24-anemone>24. Anemone:</span></h2><p><span style="line-height: 18px;"><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Anemone flower is said to bring luck" alt="Anemone flower is said to bring luck" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Anemone flower is said to bring luck" alt="Anemone flower is said to bring luck" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Anemone flower is said to bring luck" alt="Anemone flower is said to bring luck" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Anemone.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></span></p><p>Anemone comes in bright vivid colors and blooms in spring, summer and fall. This flower is believed to bring luck and protect against evil and other harmful forces. It also carries magical and prophetic tales with itself, and thus is called anticipation in the language of flowers.<br> via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/28006828904541323/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a><br></p><div class=protip_external><div class=protip_inner><div class=protip_title><img class="nopin lh-lazy-image" alt=protip_icon width=32px height=32px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/protips/trivia.svg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/noimage-min.jpg><noscript><img class=nopin data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/noimage-min.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/protips/trivia.svg alt=protip_icon width=32px height=32px></noscript> Trivia</div><div class=protip_content>The name is derived from the Greek word “anemos,” meaning “wind.” That’s why anemones are also known as wind flowers.</div></div></div><br><div class=sc-rltd-head>Related: <a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/beautiful-daffodil-flowers/ title="Top 25 Most Beautiful Daffodil Flowers" class=sc-reltd>Top 25 Most Beautiful Daffodil Flowers</a></div><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=25-brunnea>25. Brunnea:</span></h2><p><a href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg><div class="pinit-show-btn test"> <span class=imgshare_buttons> <picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg.webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Brunnea flowers appear in early spring" alt="Brunnea flowers appear in early spring" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Brunnea flowers appear in early spring" alt="Brunnea flowers appear in early spring" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px data-defaultsrc=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/noimage700x450.jpg.webp src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg></picture></noscript><noscript> <picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img decoding=async class="aligncenter   webpexpress-processed" title="Brunnea flowers appear in early spring" alt="Brunnea flowers appear in early spring" width=448 height=448 style=min-height:330px src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg sc-data-path=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg></picture></noscript> <span class="imgshare_buttons_wrap wrapeshare"> <a data-pin-do=buttonPin data-pin-tall=true href="https://www.pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=%5Bpinterest_url%5D&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/Brunnea.jpg&description=%5Bpinterest_title%5D" data-pin-height=28 class="pin_image_share aligncenter"></a> </span> </span></div><div class=clear></div></a></p><p>Brunnea is a 5-petaled tiny blue flower with sprays held above the foliage. These airy sprays of blue flowers appear in early spring and have a striking resemblance to forget me not flowers.</p><p>via <a href=http://pinterest.com/pin/190769734187786692/ rel=" dofollow" target=_blank>pinterest</a></p><div class=infographic_div><h2><span class=sc-toc-section id=infographic-top-10-brilliant-blue-flowers-for-your-garden>Infographic: Top 10 Brilliant Blue Flowers For Your Garden</span></h2><p>Blue flowers are some of the most elegant and graceful blooms in the world of florals. Though the color is quite difficult to find naturally in flowers, there are around 25 beautiful blue flowers across the world that can be suitable to plant in your garden. From the rich hues of cobalt, sapphire, and navy to the soft shades of indigo and sky blue, blue flowers are a timeless and beautiful choice for any occasion. Awestruck? Well, there are some particularly beautiful blue flowers that you have to keep an eye on.</p><p>Check out the infographic below to know about the top ten brilliant blue flowers to add to your garden to enhance the beauty of your home.</p><figure id=infographic_img><picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/blue-beautiful-flower-1-1-scaled.jpg.webp><img class="nopin webpexpress-processed" style="width: 100%;" width=700 height=6000 alt="top 10 brilliant blue beautiful flowers for your garden (infographic)" data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/blue-beautiful-flower-1-1-scaled.jpg></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/blue-beautiful-flower-1-1-scaled.jpg.webp type=image/webp><img class="nopin webpexpress-processed" style="width: 100%;" src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/blue-beautiful-flower-1-1-scaled.jpg width=700 height=6000 alt="top 10 brilliant blue beautiful flowers for your garden (infographic)"></picture></noscript><div class=newpinit_sc_new><a class="PIN_1677159674330_button_pin PIN_1677159674330_save PIN_1677159674330_tall" href="http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-blue-flowers/&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/blue-beautiful-flower-1-1-scaled.jpg" data-pin-log=button_pinit data-pin-href="http://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-blue-flowers/&media=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/blue-beautiful-flower-1-1-scaled.jpg">Save</a></div><p class=wp-caption-text>Illustration: StyleCraze Design Team</p></figure><div class=inf-gph-dwn><div class="col-lg-8 col-xs-8 mpd"><div class=dwnld-txt><p>Save the high-quality PDF version on your device now.</p> 	<a class=info-dwnld href=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/infographics/infographic_top_10_brilliant_blue_flowers_for_your_garden.pdf target=_blank download> <span class=info-dwnld-icon><img class="nopin lh-lazy-image" alt="Download Infographic in PDF version" height=17px width=17px data-src=https://www.stylecraze.com/wp-content/themes/buddyboss-child/images/download.svg><noscript><img class=nopin src=https://www.stylecraze.com/wp-content/themes/buddyboss-child/images/download.svg alt="Download Infographic in PDF version" height=17px width=17px></noscript></span> Download Infographic</a></div></div><div class="col-lg-4 col-xs-4 pd0"><div class=dwnld-bg> 	<img class="nopin lh-lazy-image" alt="Download Infographic in PDF version" height=70px width=200px data-src=https://www.stylecraze.com/wp-content/themes/buddyboss-child/images/svg-image/infographic-download-vector-sc.png><noscript><img class=nopin src=https://www.stylecraze.com/wp-content/themes/buddyboss-child/images/svg-image/infographic-download-vector-sc.png alt="Download Infographic in PDF version" height=70px width=200px></noscript></div></div></div></div><div id=conclusion_div><p>Blue is a dreamy color related to the emotions and hopes of people. It has a cooling and calming effect and is often associated with spirituality and intellect. Blue flowers are quite rare to be found. The shades of blue symbolize different fortunes. Blue hydrangea, delphinium, dandelion, grape hyacinth, and clematis are the most beautiful blue flowers found globally. Blue periwinkle, larkspur, lupine, blue pansy, petunia, and verbena are some of the other beautiful blue flowers that you can add to your floral arrangement. With their unique shapes and shades of blue, these flowers are sure to impress and delight. However, some believe that they may reduce appetite and slow down metabolism. Hence, practice caution and consult your health care provider for more information.</p></div><h2 class="qatitle"><span class=sc-toc-section id=frequently-asked-questions>Frequently Asked Questions</span></h2><p class=llist>Is there a true blue rose?</p><p class=ltext>No. A blue rose does not exist in nature. You can either dye a white rose blue or opt for a genetically modified blue rose.</p><p class=llist>Why are blue flowers so rare?</p><p class=ltext>Unlike other colors in nature, blue pigments are very rare in flowers. Hence, natural blue flowers are uncommon to find.</p><p class=llist>Which plant is known as the blue plant?</p><p class=ltext>Brunonia, also known as the blue pincushion, is an Australian perennial herb that produces blue five-lobed flowers. It is also called the blue plant.</p><p><iframe class="article_vdo lazy-iframe" title="YouTube video player" src=about:blank data-src=https://www.youtube.com/embed/zbUv3Sjfgqk width=560 height=315 frameborder=0 allowfullscreen=allowfullscreen></iframe><br></p><div id=adx_native_ad_111220 class=advertinside style=min-height:250px;></div><iframe class="article_vdo lazy-iframe" title="YouTube video player" src=about:blank data-src=https://www.youtube.com/embed/4LkOisEUtGQ width=560 height=315 frameborder=0 allowfullscreen=allowfullscreen></iframe><div id=M863476ScriptRootC1417957 class=advertinside style=min-height:250px;></div><div><div class=info_help><b><span>Was this article helpful? </span></b><div class=decision><a class="feedbackLink2 yes" href=https://www.stylecraze.com/feedback-form/215625/yes/ ><img alt=thumbsup width=20 height=20 class="nopin lh-lazy-image" data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/thumbsup.svg><noscript><img src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/thumbsup.svg alt=thumbsup width=20 height=20 class=nopin></noscript></a><a class="feedbackLink1 no" href=https://www.stylecraze.com/feedback-form/215625/no/ ><img alt=thumbsdown width=20 height=20 class="nopin lh-lazy-image" data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/thumbsdown.svg><noscript><img src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/static-content/thumbsdown.svg alt=thumbsdown width=20 height=20 class=nopin></noscript></a></div></div></div><div id=jp-relatedposts class=jp-relatedposts><h3 class="jp-relatedposts-headline"><em>Related</em></h3></div><div id=ts-fab-215625 class=ts-fab-wrapper data-url=https://www.stylecraze.com/articles/most-beautiful-blue-flowers/ ><span class=screen-reader-text>The following two tabs change content below.</span><ul class=ts-fab-list><li class="ts-fab-bio-link-215625 active"><a href=#ts-fab-bio-215625>Author</a></li></ul><div class=ts-fab-tabs><div class=ts-fab-tab id=ts-fab-bio-215625 style=display:none><div class=prof><div class=ts-fab-avatar><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ target=_blank><picture class=lh-lazy-image><source type=image/webp data-srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png.webp><img alt class="avatar photo avatar-default webpexpress-processed" height=80 width=80 data-src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png></picture><noscript><picture><source srcset=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png.webp type=image/webp><img alt src=https://cdn2.stylecraze.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Ramya_Karamsetti-PNG.png class="avatar photo avatar-default webpexpress-processed" height=80 width=80></picture></noscript></a></div><div class=ts-fab-text><div class=ts-fab-header><h4><a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ >Ramya Karamsetti</a><span class=author_designation>Contributor</span></h4><span class=social-links></span></div></div></div><div class=ts-fab-content>Ramya Karamsetti is a contributor to StyleCraze. She loves writing articles on beauty, health, and wellness and advocates using natural remedies to solve everyday skin and hair issues. When she is not writing, she loves traveling and going on adventure trips.<a href=https://www.stylecraze.com/author/ramya_karamsetti/ target=_blank class=author-btns>more</a></div></div></div></div></div></article></section></article><div class=clearfix></div></div></div><div id=secondary class=widget-area style=max-width:300px;float:right;><aside id=text-3 class="widget widget_text"><div class=textwidget></div></aside><aside id=text-12 class="widget widget_text"><div class=textwidget><div class="advert hidden-xs" id=sidebar_first_ad_container style="margin: 20px 0;"><div id=div-gpt-ad-1572606084681-0 style=min-height:600px;> <script>if(!is_mobile_sc()){googletag.cmd.push(function(){googletag.pubads().refresh([sidebar_first_slot]);});}</script></div></div><div class=clear>